WEBVTT

00:09:57.829 --> 00:10:01.079
it's going to make it really hard
for us to work together.

00:10:01.121 --> 00:10:03.287
I just want you to be successful here.

00:10:03.329 --> 00:10:04.912
I'm just trying to support you."

00:10:06.412 --> 00:10:07.996
Who's the victim now?

00:10:08.996 --> 00:10:11.287
Her attempts to gaslight me,

00:10:11.329 --> 00:10:13.454
to psychologically manipulate me

00:10:13.496 --> 00:10:15.579
into questioning my own reality

00:10:15.621 --> 00:10:16.871
was futile.

00:10:17.537 --> 00:10:19.287
Even then, in that moment,

00:10:19.329 --> 00:10:22.412
I knew that my experience was not unique.

00:10:23.454 --> 00:10:27.037
For too many Black women
and other people of color,

00:10:27.079 --> 00:10:29.037
people living with disabilities,

00:10:29.079 --> 00:10:32.162
nonbinary people, deaf people,